    "problemStatement": "Given an array AAA of length NNN.\n\nThere is an integer variable XXX and a score SSS. Initially, X=0X = 0X=0 and S=0S = 0S=0.\n\nYou play the following single-player game on the array AAA for the next NNN seconds:\n\n\nIn the ttt-th second (1≤t≤N1 \\le t \\le N1≤t≤N), you **may** choose any index iii such that 1≤i≤N1 \\le i \\le N1≤i≤N and t∣it \\mid it∣i (i.e., iii is a multiple of ttt).\nThen, update the score SSS as follows: S=S+∣X−Ai∣S = S + \\lvert X - A_i \\rvertS=S+∣X−Ai​∣.\nThen, set X=AiX = A_iX=Ai​.\nAlternatively, you can also choose to do nothing in the ttt-th second (both XXX and SSS remain unchanged).\nDefine f(A)f(A)f(A) to be the maximum possible final score SSS that can be achieved by playing the game optimally.\n\nYou are given an array AAA of length NNN. You need to handle QQQ updates to the array. Each update is of the form (i,x)(i, x)(i,x) and means: set Ai=xA_i = xAi​=x. Output the value of f(A)f(A)f(A) after each update.\n\n**Important note on test generation (read carefully):** For all the official tests, the update index iii in each pair (i,x)(i, x)(i,x) is generated uniformly at random from {1,2,…,N}\\{1, 2, \\dots, N\\}{1,2,…,N}, independently across updates. Note that only the indices are constrained this way, the new values xxx may be arbitrary within the given bounds.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input will contain a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nEach test case consists of multiple lines of input.\n\nThe first line of each test case contains two space-separated integers NNN and QQQ — the number of elements in the array and the number of updates to handle, respectively.\nThe next line contains NNN space-separated integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\dots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​ — the initial array.\nThe next QQQ lines describe the updates. The kkk-th of these lines contains two space-separated integers iki_kik​ and xkx_kxk​, indicating the assignment Aik=xkA_{i_k} = x_kAik​​=xk​.\n\n\n\n\nOutput Format\nAfter each update, output on a new line the current value of f(A)f(A)f(A).",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1041 \\le T \\le 10^41≤T≤104",
