      "1≤Ai≤1091 \\le A_i \\le 10^91≤Ai​≤109",
      "1≤xk≤1091 \\le x_k \\le 10^91≤xk​≤109",
      "1≤ik≤N1 \\le i_k \\le N1≤ik​≤N",
      "Each iki_kik​ is generated uniformly randomly in the interval [1,N][1, N][1,N].",
      "The sum of NNN across all test cases won't exceed 2⋅1052 \\cdot 10^52⋅105",
      "The sum of QQQ across all test cases won't exceed 5⋅1045 \\cdot 10^45⋅104"
